.TH NAMES 1.SH NAMEnames \- an address book, in German.SH SYNOPSIS\fBnames\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fIAdressen Verwaltung\fR1.0: a full-screen address book whose text is in German.  Each recordholds Anrede (title), Nachname (surname), Vorname (first name), Strasse(street), PLZ (postcode), Stadt (town), Telefon and two Bemerkung (note)lines.  It keeps them in a file of its own under\fB/dd/SYS\fR,\fRwhich it creates the first time it runs.  It wants a terminal..PPIt has nothing to do with module names;\fBmodinfo\fRlists those..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOynad, phone